        <p>In most jurisdictions, removing DRM for personal use falls into a legal gray area. The DMCA in the US prohibits circumvention of DRM, though exemptions exist for format-shifting. The safest approach is to buy DRM-free EPUBs from stores that sell them without DRM. This guide focuses entirely on legal DRM-free sources.</p>
      </div>
